Code2MP4 public documentation and release repository

The default branch contains public documentation and repository tooling.
These public materials use the Apache License, Version 2.0 in LICENSE.

The early open-source implementation and its original attribution are
preserved in the legacy-open-source branch. A copy of that original
NOTICE is retained at legacy/NOTICE for historical attribution.

The independently developed closed-source desktop application is
distributed separately. Its actual release packages supply the applicable
application terms and third-party notices. This documentation repository
does not represent a component inventory for those application builds.
